<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-VAN GOBBEL LEAVES GALATASARAY FOR SOUTHAMPTON.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VAN GOBBEL LEAVES GALATASARAY FOR SOUTHAMPTON.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch international defender Ulrich van Gobbel has left Turkey's Galatasaray for English premier league Southampton, a Galatasaray official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He said former Galatasaray trainer Graeme Souness had signed Van Gobbel for his new club. He gave no further details.</p>
</text>
